---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Real Life Friends | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Stay Curious For Real Connections - An AI-powered app for meaningful human connections" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Real Life Friends</h1>
			<p>
				Real Life Friends is an AI-powered application that helps people build genuine, meaningful relationships 
				through curiosity-driven conversations. Stay curious for real connections.
			</p>

			<h2>The Problem</h2>
			<p>
				In our hyper-connected world, true connection is becoming rare. Social media encourages 
				surface-level interactions, and meaningful conversations are being replaced by quick reactions 
				and fleeting exchanges.
			</p>

			<h2>Our Solution</h2>
			<p>
				RLF uses AI to facilitate deeper conversations by encouraging curiosity. Instead of 
				defaulting to small talk, the app guides users toward questions and topics that reveal 
				who people really are—their passions, experiences, and perspectives.
			</p>

			<h2>Key Features</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Curiosity Prompts</strong> – AI-generated conversation starters that go beyond the surface</li>
				<li><strong>Connection Insights</strong> – Understand your conversation patterns and how to deepen relationships</li>
				<li><strong>Real Conversations</strong> – Tools designed for in-person meetups, not endless messaging</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Status</h2>
			<p>
				RLF is currently in development. Stay tuned for updates.
			</p>

			<p>
				<a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
